        "cooked": "<p>My wife and I had a similar set of games with Citizen Dawn: First game, she creamed us in about fifteen minutes. We reset the board with all the same decks. Second game, we walloped her in about fifteen minutes.</p>\n<p>Somehow, I enjoyed our three-hour marathon battle against her at a friend’s game night better!</p>",
