        "created_at": "2015-10-05T21:51:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ah -- my subject line does suggest I &nbsp;meant to imply that Omnitron is swingy. I actually think there are far swingier villains (agree that Apostate is a good example). All villains are at least somewhat swingy and I happened to experience a swing between these two games, but in reality I find Cosmic Omnitron pretty reliably challenging.</p>",
